WEBVTT

Your AI app
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.667
Talk to your Figma files, from the AI app you already use.

Add a file
00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:08.267
Get a Figma file, and add it to the chat.

Ask what's in it
00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:16.200
Ask what's in it: grafta reads its layers, variables and a picture.

Change it, check it
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:24.333
Change it, and check it. It saves a new file, never over yours.

Turn it into code
00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:35.933
Turn it into code, in whatever language you work in.

Open it in Figma
00:00:35.933 --> 00:00:48.333
Open the new file in Figma: real layers and variables, to keep editing.
